참조: [Data Visualization with ggplot2::Cheat Sheet "Coordinate Systems"](https://rstudio.github.io/cheatsheets/html/data-visualization.html#coordinate-systems)


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
library(ggplot2)
d <- ggplot(mpg, aes(fl))
u <- d + geom_bar()
u
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-coordinate_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-1-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### coord_cartesian()

- 기본 카테시안 좌표계
- xlim, ylim


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
u + coord_cartesian(xlim = c(0, 5))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-coordinate_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-2-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### coord_fixed()

- x축 y축 비율이 고정된 카테시안 좌표계
- ratio, xlim, ylim


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
u + coord_fixed(ratio = 1 / 2)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-coordinate_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-3-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### 축 바꾸기

- x축, y축 전환(flip)


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
ggplot(mpg, aes(y = fl)) + geom_bar()
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-coordinate_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### coord_polar()

- 극좌표계
- theta, start, direction


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
u + coord_polar(theta = "x", direction = 1)
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-coordinate_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-5-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### coord_trans()

- 카테시안 좌표계 변환
- x, y, xlim, ylim


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
u + coord_trans(y = "sqrt")
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stderr}

```
Warning: `coord_trans()` was deprecated in ggplot2 4.0.0.
ℹ Please use `coord_transform()` instead.
```


:::

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-coordinate_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-6-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::


##### coord_sf()

- 모든 레이어가 공통 좌표계를 사용하도록 지정
- xlim, ylim, crs


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
# 에러 확인요
π + coord_sf()
```
:::
